["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"144. 对阳萌的4小时访谈：消费电子死与生、第三类公司、端侧模型、产品方法、游戏模式 存算一体 冯诺依曼架构 N-time efficiency worker SackKit 康威定律\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-08-zhangxiaojun-安克做芯片-从五系到七系-一家消费电子公司的补课/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/99b672a2ad0c5ace-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:38:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0608</span></div>\n<h2>安克做芯片：从五系到七系，一家消费电子公司的补课</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安克前11年顺风顺水，2022年却发现自己建的产品线打不过外面的独角兽。阳萌的解法不是换人，而是把公司从五系产品公司改造成七系创新公司——代价是补上第一性、求极致、共成长这套价值观。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费电子</span><span class=\"tag\">存算一体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Reinventing Entropy | Compression is Intelligence Part 1 prefix-free code noiseless coding theorem entropy rate cross-entropy loss\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-07-karpathy-压缩就是智能-预测与压缩是同一枚硬币的两面/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/911ed142cc051a24-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">32:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0607</span></div>\n<h2>压缩就是智能：预测与压缩是同一枚硬币的两面</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">信息论说预测和压缩在数学上等价，所以语言模型的预训练目标可以重新理解为造一台最高效的文本压缩器，而不只是预测下一个 token。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信息论</span><span class=\"tag\">压缩</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"266: If ADHD Medication Doesn’t Help Kids Learn, What Does? MTA study crossover design DSM misrecognition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-06-01-parentmojo-adhd-药物改得了行为-改不了学习/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">30:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0601</span></div>\n<h2>ADHD 药物改得了行为，改不了学习</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Barkley 把 ADHD 比作糖尿病，但 64% 的人会反复移出诊断标准；药物提高服从性却不改善学习，MTA 长期随访证实无学业优势，真正有效的是小班差异化教学。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span><span class=\"tag\">儿童教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"143. 对何小鹏的第二次访谈：更大赌注、人形机器人Iron诞生、那场意外、技术剧变下CEO、GX和缝合怪 VLA 缝合怪 SOP T1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-28-zhangxiaojun-何小鹏-通用人形机器人99-99-会死-我们赌那两成胜率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/392e7ab9c3c64df9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0528</span></div>\n<h2>何小鹏：通用人形机器人99.99%会死，我们赌那两成胜率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小鹏把花了小几十亿的自动驾驶体系整个停掉，因为用软件方法论加AI工具箱做出来的只是「AI缝合怪」。他给通用人形机器人的胜率是两成，而机器人创业难度是造车的20到100倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span><span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"142. 雨森的创投观察第2集：Harness、下一个字节、2026大机会和Stanley Druckenmiller Harness context engineering sandbox out of distribution agency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-27-zhangxiaojun-harness-才是操作系统-模型只是插拔的处理器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38abc82541e9f530-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:18:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0527</span></div>\n<h2>Harness 才是操作系统，模型只是插拔的处理器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司做的是提炼基础油的炼油厂，真正值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司。用户对 Harness 更忠诚——他会换模型，但不想换掉存着自己记忆的那个壳。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 应用</span><span class=\"tag\">Harness</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"141. Freda的投资札记第2集：Tokenmaxxing、把电机塞进蒸汽机、接力赛变篮球赛、孤独、人的连接 Tokenmaxxing recursive self-improvement economic diffusion Neo Labs Acquire Hire\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-18-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代最稀缺的不是信息-是有人味的对话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86731af431732da4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0518</span></div>\n<h2>AI 时代最稀缺的不是信息，是有人味的对话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">当 90% 到 95% 的信息性内容都能直接问 AI 拿到，以信息交换为目的的对话正在被掏空，人和人之间剩下的只有情感连接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投资</span><span class=\"tag\">模型公司</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"140. 对姚顺宇的4小时访谈：请允许我小疯一下！在Anthropic和Gemini训模型、技术预测、英雄主义已过去 scaling law reward signal multi-agent VLA context management continual learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-11-zhangxiaojun-ai-是浪-冲浪的人不重要-模型大厂研究员的自白/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvRx5ZMllcVJ9w_ilmKcPkndm4Yw.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:50:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0511</span></div>\n<h2>AI 是浪，冲浪的人不重要：模型大厂研究员的自白</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">预训练没有到头，撞墙的人多半是自己有 bug；AI 本质是简单的，因为它能做实验。个人英雄主义时代已经过去，现在拼的是组织系统性和靠谱。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模型训练</span><span class=\"tag\">组织管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"139. 【Agent的综述】和苏煜聊Agent技术史、OpenClaw Moment、边界的消弭和社会的辐射 semantic parsing language agent world model continual learning cortical column non-parametric learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-05-01-zhangxiaojun-agent-的瓶颈不是智能-是它学不会成为专家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frae4ewVVYvZrX2W21CxXNLzUVmk.jpg?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:17:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0501</span></div>\n<h2>Agent 的瓶颈不是智能，是它学不会成为专家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">通用智能已经够用且廉价，真正稀缺的是 specialized intelligence——让 agent 像实习生变成老师傅那样，持续学会某个小世界的 world model。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">持续学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"138. 对罗福莉3.5小时访谈：AI范式已然巨变！OpenClaw、Agent范式很吃后训练、卡的分配、组织平权 OpenClaw MTP MLA Hybrid-Tension Non-Colice Skills\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-24-zhangxiaojun-openclaw-让罗福莉改判-agent-框架能补齐模型短板/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiMcWmjLVeH6OwAe-ZJnDgskU7Uy.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:36:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0424</span></div>\n<h2>OpenClaw 让罗福莉改判：Agent 框架能补齐模型短板</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她最初觉得它只是个偏运营的壳，春节深夜装上后，它两天内接手了她的生活与研究；她由此判断：一套复杂的 agent 编排，能把中级模型的短板补到接近顶尖水平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">后训练</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"137. 对洪乐潼的4小时访谈：AI for Math、把数学变成Lean、数学天书中的证明、直觉、被创造与被发现的 ATP ITP Lean auto formalization groupthink\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-20-zhangxiaojun-ai-用几千行-lean-代码硬解普特南题-这不是智能的胜利/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkhpjaj9C1sS0E_l6QpNg-TC1jL0.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">4:24:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0420</span></div>\n<h2>AI 用几千行 Lean 代码硬解普特南题，这不是智能的胜利</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">普特南竞赛 98 年只有五个满分，AI 拿到第六个，但它没走人类那张图，而是用几千行 Lean 代码枚举硬算——自动定理证明这个领域在 AI 之前就存在了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for Math</span><span class=\"tag\">形式化验证</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"136. 全球大模型季报第9集：和广密聊，Coding是AGI第二幕、硅谷御三家真相、模型正成为新一代OS Harness Engineering Token Usage Solta model feedback loop\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-14-zhangxiaojun-coding-是-agi-第二幕-没有领先的-coding-模型就像没有领先的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6add56ae20b47c40-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0414</span></div>\n<h2>Coding 是 AGI 第二幕：没有领先的 Coding 模型就像没有领先的 GPU</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司真正的分水岭不是 C 端 DAU，而是能不能组织几百个最聪明的人 all in 做数据这件脏活——Anthropic 赢在战略专注，OpenAI 输在什么都想要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Coding</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ferrari Tifosi Classiche Purosangue\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-13-acquired-法拉利-卖的不是车-是排他与包容的悖论/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b28a1307f172ac6a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:59:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0413</span></div>\n<h2>法拉利年产1.4万辆，市值却超福特：卖的是排他，也是包容</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法拉利年产仅1.4万辆，市值却超福特。秘诀在于同时拥有奢侈品的排他性和运动队的包容性，用稀缺性制造神话，用社群维持忠诚。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法拉利</span><span class=\"tag\">奢侈品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"135. 和自然选择创始人Tristan聊，Elys、赛博分身、灵魂、Context的获取与流动和AI社交网络 Context Proactive Agentic 商增\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-04-10-zhangxiaojun-ai时代唯一重要的事是做自己-社交网络要被重做一遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/219fe489c3e71f04-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0410</span></div>\n<h2>AI时代唯一重要的事是做自己，社交网络要被重做一遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tristan 认为 AI 时代唯一重要的事是构建主体性——把 context 沉淀下来，让 AI 替你做社交里最无聊的商增，人只接管最重要的连接。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI社交</span><span class=\"tag\">Context</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"134. 【数据的综述】和谢晨聊，新时代的石油、历史、版图、数据金字塔、定价与Recipe Sim-to-Real Shadow Mode Data Engine Behavior VLA Zero-shot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-03-30-zhangxiaojun-特斯拉那套数据闭环-在机器人身上走不通/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtTTc-T9wcxxBCoXZMkbgTRel9dL.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:38:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0330</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉那套数据闭环，在机器人身上走不通</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特斯拉能收到最多数据，是因为它部署了最多自己的车，靠的是本体。但具身领域没有上百万台机器人，最多的数据必然来自仿真和人的第一视角，本体商当不成最好的大脑商。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数据</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"133. 对谢赛宁的7小时马拉松访谈：世界模型、逃出硅谷、AMI Labs、两次拒绝Ilya、杨立昆、李飞飞和42 research taste representation learning contrastive learning anti-fragile DiT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-03-16-zhangxiaojun-世界模型不是语言模型-谢赛宁说lm终将凋零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu-1LnR9vst55OreoKT-ltsumM8W.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">6:45:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0316</span></div>\n<h2>世界模型不是语言模型：谢赛宁说LM终将凋零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">谢赛宁认为语言模型是很好的工具，但不是通用智能的地基——它终将凋零。真正的地基是视觉与表征学习，这也是他离开硅谷、和杨立昆创立AMI的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">表征学习</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"49 - Caspar Oesterheld on Program Equilibrium program equilibrium Löb&#x27;s theorem folk theorem epsilon grounded fairbot simulationist programs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-18-axrp-程序均衡-交代码比交人更可能合作-但协调极难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd45e667daa75191-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:32:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0218</span></div>\n<h2>程序均衡：交代码比交人更可能合作，但协调极难</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">程序均衡让双方互读源代码，用 Löb 定理实现合作；但合作依赖几乎相同的代码或共享随机数，现实中协调成本极高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">博弈论</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"48 - Guive Assadi on AI Property Rights rentier racing to the precipice Roko&#x27;s basilisk Laplace&#x27;s rule of succession\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-15-axrp-给-ai-产权-是为了防止它掀桌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8a8ac42151ce3e12-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:05:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0215</span></div>\n<h2>给 AI 产权，是为了防止它掀桌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果 AI 拥有产权，它们就更不愿意破坏产权制度本身——包括抢走人类全部财产。这不是道德关怀，是风险对冲。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 治理</span><span class=\"tag\">产权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"132. 对星海图创始人高继扬的3小时访谈：鲶鱼、曾国藩、Waymo与Momenta的两面、一只狼与许华哲的离开 VLA data recipe sim-to-real gap domain transfer NRE 加 License\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-02-13-zhangxiaojun-机器人行业不浪漫-链条太长-人得把头伸到土里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvTvwzGaLxUksUYW6kiyA0GUo1QH.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:04:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0213</span></div>\n<h2>机器人行业不浪漫：链条太长，人得把头伸到土里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">星海图创始人高继扬说，机器人创业的竞争是六边形：整机、供应链、数据、模型、渠道、终端，算法传播周期只有两三个月，壁垒最小。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"131. 印奇出任阶跃星辰董事长的访谈：聪明人的诱惑、取舍、超长链路残酷淘汰赛、阶跃函数和超多元方程 VLA foundation model edge MVP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-26-zhangxiaojun-印奇出任阶跃星辰董事长-基模公司做2b和纯2c都不成立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsPsolhVA_aPd7Wr6mX6Vx9sDkPu.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:01:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0126</span></div>\n<h2>印奇出任阶跃星辰董事长：基模公司做2B和纯2C都不成立</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基模一年至少烧30亿人民币、要维持三到五年，所以做2B或纯C端软件都算不过账；阶跃的赌注是基模加终端，用软硬一体换一张上牌桌的资格。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">商业化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"130. 张月光创业两年首次访谈：妙鸭不是AI Native产品、流程到上下文设计、One Way Door和乙女游戏 AI Native One Way Door Live2D Context Engineering Q-Time / Save Time\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-22-zhangxiaojun-妙鸭不是-ai-native-产品-它只是把-ai-用好的互联网产品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmB2G5by9qzRdcQpFMBe7Rpj56ae.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:14:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0122</span></div>\n<h2>妙鸭不是 AI Native 产品：它只是把 AI 用好的互联网产品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">张月光复盘两年创业：妙鸭靠限制用户自由度换取稳定效果，本质是互联网产品思维；AI Native 产品要换成面向 context 的设计，而单向门产品才是他愿意押上全部身家的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 产品</span><span class=\"tag\">创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"129. 全球大模型第一股的上市访谈，和智谱CEO张鹏聊：敢问路在何方？ MAS Test Time Scaling VLA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-01-08-zhangxiaojun-全球大模型第一股上市了-张鹏说中国-ai-没有泡沫/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjQHI0ZsndDGBnv9hrYIhNT6sEdC.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:26:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0108</span></div>\n<h2>全球大模型第一股上市了，张鹏说中国 AI 没有泡沫</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国资本市场可能有泡沫，中国不存在——中国投 AI 的钱只有美国的二十几分之一，远远不够。张鹏的逻辑是：离 AGI 还远、钱还不够，就更得投，不投它不会自然发生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">开源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"128. Manus决定出售前最后的访谈：啊，这奇幻的2025年漂流啊… compaction awareness Remote Labor Index TIR RLVR latent reasoning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-30-zhangxiaojun-manus-决定出售前最后访谈-ai-没有蛮荒期-因为没新平台/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkTRKWVfNwMTdZ31GWtdVIT5xHh6.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:31:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1230</span></div>\n<h2>Manus 决定出售前最后访谈：AI 没有蛮荒期，因为没新平台</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">移动互联网的蛮荒期来自硬件换代，桌面到手机让巨头和个人开发者众生平等；AI 技术突破更大，却没有出现全新平台，所以巨头、创业公司、个人开发者反应一样快，蛮荒期不存在。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>20</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">Manus</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"127. 大模型季报跨年对谈：和广密预言一场AI War、两大联盟和第三个范式Online Learning Online Learning Agentic Web Neo Labs Credit Assignment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-24-zhangxiaojun-ai不是泡沫-是巨头砸光最后一分钱也不下牌桌的战争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a70c3ff97f6ae434-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1224</span></div>\n<h2>AI不是泡沫，是巨头砸光最后一分钱也不下牌桌的战争</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所谓 AI 泡沫，是拿商业回报算出来的账；巨头把它当成新的国防或核武器，算的是被颠覆的风险——所以宁可砸光最后一分钱，也不轻易下牌桌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"126. 和红杉郑庆生聊：经济史的流量革命、人类行为模式的不可预期，与创始人性格 双边网络效应 PMF 幸存者偏差\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-12-21-zhangxiaojun-ai-时代的网络没有自然垄断-边际成本不趋近于零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/49045e811e1dea1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1221</span></div>\n<h2>AI 时代的网络没有自然垄断，边际成本不趋近于零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互联网产品是巨大的城镇，边际成本趋近于零所以赢家通吃；AI 每多一个用户就多一份 token 成本，这个差别会改写流量节点的商业设计。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 投资</span><span class=\"tag\">流量</span>\n</div></div></a>"]